<mj-text>Hi {{ customer.first_name | default: "there" }},</mj-text>
<mj-text>Your trial ends on {{ customer.trial_ends_at | date: "%-d %b %Y" | default: "soon" }}. When it ends, your subscription continues on the paid plan unless you cancel before then.</mj-text>
<mj-text>Nothing else changes: your models and Workspaces stay as they are.</mj-text>
<mj-button href="https://hydrilla.ai/app/pricing">Review your plan</mj-button>
